      "name": "note-street-station",
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "STREET STATION (2026-08-21). BG = entry-street.jpg — the CANONICAL rest still by construction (still-rest model: crisp out0 composite, cross-dissolved over video; unlike the walls, no hold-frame extraction needed). Pink rect = existing stations.ts storefront hotspot [366,158]-[1545,818] -> becomes CROSS THE STREET (hover glow + gen'd hand-scrawl label, tier-2 DOM fade-in; scrawl asset = the one gen task in this pass). Green rects = street-egg CANDIDATES over baked box stickers: LEFT (647,476 37x28, at portrait-safe edge — CD lean) vs RIGHT (1290,518 30x13, desktop-only). Al B picks one; loser gets deleted. Egg = silent, NO idle tell; click -> unreleased-track download (track pick open). TIER DISCIPLINE: hotspots-over-baked + DOM fade-ins ONLY — nothing gets baked, 07-12 reshoot stays closed. CC-side (not Pen): strip dom.heading/body + old CTA from stations.ts street entry."
